{
  "$comment": "Design 044, Technical Plan 7.4 and Requirement 044-025: the history export format, version 1. GET /runs/{runId}/history answers application/x-ndjson: a first line, the header, then one HistoryEvent per line in the proto3 JSON mapping of worker.proto (field names in lowerCamelCase, enumerations by name, 64-bit integers as strings, bytes in base64). Every payload is classified and redacted by feature 016's rules; a blob is a reference with its size only and the placeholder EXTERNAL_CONTENT_NOT_INSPECTED; a secret field is never exported. The seed is exported here only. A replayer refuses an unknown exportFormat. contract_workflow_as_code::the_history_export_format_matches_its_baseline recomputes the messages and enumerations from worker.proto; a change is a new format version or an additive change reviewed under AGENTS.md rule 18.",
